config MTK_PCE
	tristate "MediaTek Packet Classification Engine (PCE)"
	depends on NET_MEDIATEK_SOC && ARM64
	help
	  Support for the MediaTek Packet Classification Engine in NETSYS.
	  The PCE matches inbound packets (IP protocol, destination address,
	  L4 header or data) and redirects them to a MediaTek offload engine:
	  the NPU (tunnel offload) or the EIP-197 inline crypto engine. It is
	  required by CONFIG_MTK_NPU and CONFIG_MTK_CRYPTO_EIP.

	  If unsure, say N.
